  "bio": "Amanda Accetturo is a highly skilled tattoo artist based in Miami, United States, specializing in tribal, illustrative, and dotwork styles. With a comprehensive portfolio that includes not just tattooing but also fine art, piercing, permanent makeup, digital art, murals, and sculptures, Amanda's professionalism in the artistry world is unparalleled. Clients can expect a meticulous level of detail and exceptional technique in each unique piece she creates."
